* curmg: r: Magnetizing Impedance: No Load Current in %
* pfe: r: Magnetizing Impedance: No Load Losses in kW
* zx0hl_n: r: Zero Sequence Magnetizing Impedance: Mag. Impedance/uk0
* tap_side: i: Tap Changer 1: at Side:HV:LV
* dutap: r: Additional Voltage per Tap in %
* phitr: r: Phase of du in deg
* nntap0: i: Neutral Position
* ntpmn: i: Minimum Position
* ntpmx: i: Maximum Position
* manuf: a:20: Manufacturer
* chr_name: a:20: Characteristic Name
* for_name: a:50: DGS field for_name (a:50)
